  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量工作台-资质管理\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量工作台\"],\"capability_summary\":\"在EBP场景下，将组织维度的全部素材共享给另一个组织，不支持单素材共享，不支持共享给账户、主体。共享的操作人默认=共享的素材范围，仅支持共享某组织节点下【仅直属】素材。关键配合接口：【获取Access token】、【附录 - 返回码】。\",\"id\":\"ebp.material.auth.create\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/tools/ebp/material/auth/create/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1854120947746880\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get.access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"appendix.return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"用于查询接口返回码和返回信息的详细说明\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录 - 返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1854120947746880\",\"title\":\"升级版工作台素材共享\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-hz572pvq4eg00\">EBP场景下，对组织维度的素材进行共享</p><ol data-id=\"o3i5gzqam-24ala6ev9nsw00\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-52c1omqmrrk000\">仅支持将组织维度的全部素材共享给另一个组织，不支持单素材共享，不支持共享给账户、主体</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1u6d5xsuq78g00\">共享的操作人默认=共享的素材范围，仅支持共享某组织节点下【仅直属】素材</li></ol><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1852372799525952%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1743864733602830%2C%22id%22%3A%22pS5UZ%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-fhxmqndga3k00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-fhxmqndga3k00\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-48ve00f8j5400\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/tools/ebp/material/auth/create/<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1854120947746880\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-e3qjrpexmig00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-e3qjrpexmig00\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-kejogjx2to000\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-g3euwowcwc800\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-g3euwowcwc800\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-c6deizt5s4o00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-c6deizt5s4o00\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3bozr5m5www00\">账户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">账户类型，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-e1hckj1s9yw00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-j29jrlns1zk00\"><code>EBP</code> 升级版工作台（默认值）</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">target_ebps</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1lish5me6b6o00\">被共享的EBP组织，数量限制[1,20]</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">target_ebp_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-5nclxhb800c000\">被共享的EBP组织ID，不支持跨组织共享给外部组织</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">target_ebp_range</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">被共享的组织范围，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-bwhlxp74mmo00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-8um3e3n3n6000\"><code>ALL</code> 全部</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-fz6al3dyqk000\"><code>SELF</code> 仅直属</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">material_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">素材类型，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-a7eldaaic0k00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2j90i6jjj0800\"><code>VIDEO</code> 视频（默认值）</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-7qlqa08kgzw00\"><code>PLAYABLE_NEW</code> 试玩素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-8x1popcnmfc00\"><code>STRAIGHT_PLAYABLE</code> 直玩素材</li></ul></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-jgmgrvfsueo00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-jgmgrvfsueo00\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Ftools%2Febp%2Fmaterial%2Fauth%2Fcreate%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengin